WEBVTT

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.000
Fly!

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.880
Where am I going, you ask?

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.050
Don't ask stupid questions...

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.510
No need for a map,

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.050
I tossed my compass long ago.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.760
My pathos will show me the way!

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:36.270
Aren't I lonely,
walking on alone, you ask?

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.020
What a joke!

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.280
Even my shadow's in my way.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:43.910
Freedom, that's my rule!

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:47.120
Try and hold me back if you can.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.290
Before your very eyes,

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.790
I'll die a glorious death.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.800
Nobody can break my wings!

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.840
Sorry I'm late.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.640
What do you think of that?

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.050
No way.

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:52.120
Amnesia?

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.330
Marie-chan?

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:54.830
Yeah.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.160
What caused it?

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.080
Some kind of disease?

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.540
She says she doesn't
remember that, either.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:05.380
Well, she does have amnesia...

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.590
Aren't you going to
talk to Dojima-san?

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.970
You know, since he's a cop.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:12.760
I think...

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:17.890
...that would be difficult.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:22.810
Unless it's a full-blown incident,
the cops won't give you the time of day.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:26.150
But we can't just leave things
the way they are, right?

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:27.990
I know.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.410
Right, Marie...

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.780
Marie-chan, it's almost time!

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.660
<i>Last chance!</i>

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:35.660
Yes!

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:45.170
MIRACLE QUIZ!!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.040
<i>Question.</i>

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:41.170
<i>What insanely popular sentai
show spawned countless sequels...?</i>

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.960
<i>Phoenix Squadron Featherman!</i>

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.460
<i>Correct!</i>

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.800
All right!

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:49.220
<i>Rallying from such a huge deficit,</i>

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.880
A huge come-from-behind win!

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.340
Amazing...

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:52.430
<i>what a comeback you've
made in the second half!</i>

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.430
What the heck are you guys doing?

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.260
Come on, Yosuke!

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:55.890
You're late!

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:58.560
I can't believe you'd miss
this come-from-behind win!

00:03:58.560 --> 00:03:59.890
Who cares?

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:01.810
Anyway, you're talking way too loud!

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:06.610
You see, this quiz
show was really fun.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.530
You were watching TV again?

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:10.820
Marie-chan, are you
a closeted TV freak?

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:13.370
All right, here's your last chance!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.330
This is the final question!

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:16.660
Drum roll, please!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.790
What does Teddie
want to do right now?

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.290
T-Teddie, lower your voice!

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:22.080
All right, Yuki-chan!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.790
Come on, hurry up and
answer the question!

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:29.210
Tick-tock, tick-tock,
tick-tock, tick-tock...

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.130
Let's see...

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.970
Time's up! The answer is...

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:33.340
Shut up, Teddie!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:36.970
Retreat! Retreat!
Let's go somewhere else!

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:45.310
So about my memories,
how can I get them back?

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.190
Memories, huh?

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:51.700
In the first place, do memories
come back just like that?

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:54.700
Someone like the Detective
Prince might know...

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.490
Why are you mentioning
Naoto all of a sudden?

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.540
Don't yell at me out of
the blue! You scared me.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.710
Anyway, Naoto's still in the hospital.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:07.090
Even if we did get to
talk to Naoto-kun,

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:10.460
without any clues, it would be
way too hard, don't you think?

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.840
Clues...

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.680
Can we use this?

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.100
What's this?

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:22.230
Before I knew it, I was holding it.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:24.100
Before you knew it?

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.900
You mean you've had it
since before you lost your memory?

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:29.860
That could be an important clue.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:33.860
Was this a gift from
someone, by any chance?

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.740
A gift from someone?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.820
A present, huh?

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:41.750
To think that your only clue
is a gift from someone...

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:44.370
How romantic!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.000
A present...

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:50.960
What's wrong?

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:53.380
I don't feel well...

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.260
Are you okay?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:57.640
I'm okay.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.050
Don't overdo it!

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:01.100
He's right.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.430
Okay, I'm fine.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:05.020
So let's go.

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:45.640
We didn't find any clues, did we?

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.100
It's still just the first day.

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.440
No need to panic.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.270
Wait!

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:52.820
Mommy.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.730
Oh, you're such a baby!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.650
Hey, what's for dinner tonight?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.910
What's the matter?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.450
Hey...

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:05.870
Do you think I had something
like that in my life, too?

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:08.870
Sure...

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:10.460
I'll bet you did.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.460
I'm gonna try hard again tomorrow.

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:27.810
What's going on?

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:28.980
Who knows?

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:32.810
Looks like he and my dad are
doing something on the sly.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:35.440
But they look like they're having fun.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.530
Maybe it's the call of the wild?

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.580
I'm sensing the call
of the wild, too...

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.130
It's telling me to scarf
down some meat!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.330
Thanks for your order.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:49.960
Here's your beef bowl.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.120
Aika-chan?

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.960
I've been waiting for this!

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.670
Hey, don't order in
right in front of the food court!

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:02.550
Well, but I think there's something else
you should be calling her out on.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:07.970
You know, this looks like something
you'd see in a textbook or something, huh?

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:12.600
Now that you mention it, it kinda
does look like a work of art.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:14.310
Art...

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:18.360
Speaking of art, there's Daidara.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.320
Something you wanna ask me?

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:25.080
Unless it's about art, no thanks!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:28.910
Oh, uh, we'd like you to
take a look at something.

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.660
Do you know what this is?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.630
Now this is good stuff.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.630
It's well-worn like
you wouldn't believe.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:39.590
And yet, there are so few scratches...

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.340
What on earth is this thing?

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:45.470
Uh, isn't there some kind of clue?

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:47.060
Anything will do!

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.730
Like, it looks like a comb but
it's really a weapon, you know?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:55.190
It's either an ornament, or maybe
something you'd use at a festival.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.610
I can't even begin to
guess what era it's from...

00:08:58.610 --> 00:08:59.610
I see...

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.780
At any rate, it's not ordinary.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:04.780
It's so beautiful,
it can't be from this world.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.780
Not from this world?

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:08.740
Then from what world?

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.120
What do you mean?

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.450
I don't get it!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:13.870
Marie-chan!

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.170
Are you all right?

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:16.960
No, I'm not all right.

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:19.050
My head hurts...

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.130
H-Hey!

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:21.800
Marie-chan!

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.760
Are you okay?

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:24.130
Hang on, I'll go get my first-aid kit!

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.180
We should find her
somewhere to lie down, right?

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.300
Oh, my goodness!

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.640
Marie-chan, hang in there!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.070
Where am I?

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:46.320
This comb is really quite old.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.580
It doesn't seem like
an everyday item,

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:53.580
but how unusual for a young
girl to bring such a thing in.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:56.750
We're thinking it might be a gift...

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.250
I wonder...

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:01.710
You see, combs aren't
suitable as gifts.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:07.390
It's written with the characters for
"suffering" and "death," you see.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:11.350
A comb has this power
that leads to parting, they say.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.430
Suffering...

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.100
Death...

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.100
Parting...

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:22.860
Then the memories
I'm searching for are...

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:28.240
"Suffering" and "death," huh?

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:31.240
Yeah, you wouldn't
give that to anybody.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:36.120
Marie-chan...

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:41.340
You sure you're okay to be up?

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:43.670
Are you all right?

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:49.590
Marie...

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:53.640
I'm... all right now...

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.020
So I'm going home by myself...

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.980
Is she really okay?

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.650
That Marie-chan?

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.210
Let's play today.

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:28.470
But...

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:29.550
Are you sure?

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:31.010
What about your memory search?

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.680
Let's go look at clothes.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.100
Uh...

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:40.520
Hey, Narukami-kun, what's up
with Marie-chan all of a sudden?

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:44.320
Marie-chan, you sure you're all right?

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.610
Yes, I'm fine.

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:48.240
All right!

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.110
Then today, let's play up a storm!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.410
Ta-da!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:56.490
Hey. Looking good!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.500
You really do have an eye
for fashion, Marie-chan!

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:03.250
What do you think, Senpai?

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.750
Aside from your high-brow views...

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:07.300
Pass.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.220
Pretty stylish!

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:13.140
No, your taste is suspect!

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.640
Your taste is...

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.890
Hey, hey, let's go eat crepes!

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:20.440
Crepes?

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.810
Yes! I hear there's a new
crepe shop in this mall!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:27.190
I've never eaten a crepe.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:28.230
Really?

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:29.400
They're really good!

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:31.070
I see.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.450
I'd like to try one.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.780
Then it's settled!

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:35.990
What flavor do you like, Senpai?

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:36.790
Let's see...

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:39.910
Maybe I'll get a honey one!

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:52.180
What am I doing, exactly?

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:58.430
Everyone...

00:12:58.770 --> 00:12:59.930
Where are they?

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.190
I-I'm so sorry!

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.440
Did you hurt yourself?

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:10.690
Everybody...

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:13.360
Where?

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:15.530
Find her?

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:17.700
She wasn't on the other side.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:18.830
How about your end?

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.950
No good, she wasn't over here, either.

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.580
Marie-chan, where
the heck did you go?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:26.130
How about we split up
and search some more?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.250
Call my cell the minute you find her.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:29.420
Gotcha.

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:36.590
I'm telling you,
call everyone here!

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:41.810
Miss, I told you, I need you to tell me
your real name, not your nickname...

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:42.230
Please calm down!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.980
I told you, I don't know it!

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:46.730
Uh...

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.480
Sorry...

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.990
She's a friend of ours...

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.450
Marie?

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:54.820
Hey, wait!

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:55.990
Hey!

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:00.490
Marie!

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:02.790
What's wrong?

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:07.130
It's nothing...

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:09.000
I'm calling it a day.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.340
Hold up a second!

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.880
What happened, exactly?

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.550
He asked me my name.

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:21.470
Not Marie, but my real name.

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.770
And I don't know what it is.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.900
Where do you live?

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.520
How old are you?

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:31.270
Where do you go to school?

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:33.530
I don't know any of that stuff...

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:35.400
I don't know that stuff!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:36.200
Calm down.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.910
I was trying to remember
because I didn't know!

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:42.950
But my head starts
hurting right away...

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:45.120
I can't remember anything...

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.290
Seriously, it's so annoying!

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.330
Marie...

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:52.090
I'm so scared...

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.670
Because I can't remember anything.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:57.300
All I have is borrowed...

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.590
Where I belong...

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:00.300
Even this name...

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.940
Marie-chan didn't show up
again today, huh?

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:13.270
Yeah.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:17.030
In the end, we couldn't do
anything for her, could we?

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:19.200
I wonder if we caused
her too much trouble.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.700
Marie-chan...

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:25.080
Marie-chan hasn't
contacted you, either, then?

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.500
No.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:39.340
<i>All right, here's this week's
Zenkoku Ohdan Miracle Quiz!</i>

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:44.260
<i>Who will it be to win
the title, "King of Miracle"?</i>

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:43.350
What's up?

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:45.220
<i>Man, you won't believe this!</i>

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.980
<i>It's Teddie...</i>

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:49.690
<i>Just now he was all
pumped up, building a set,</i>

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:53.190
<i>and now he's saying,
"Hey, let's do a quiz show!"</i>

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:56.190
<i>On top of that, he's dragged
my old man into it, too...</i>

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:59.400
<i>He's like, "It's a way to attract
customers!" and he's thrilled!</i>

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.700
<i>Can you believe it?</i>

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:03.030
<i>I mean, in the first place,
why do a quiz show?</i>

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:06.370
<i>Of all the events we could be holding,
why does he have to pick that one?</i>

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:08.960
<i>Like, we could get
an idol singer to come, or...</i>

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.170
Quiz?

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:13.380
<i>Speaking of psychological
experiments conducted at prisons...</i>

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:14.840
That's it!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:16.250
<i>...the Stanford Prison
Experiment is well-known, but...</i>

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:22.680
What?

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:25.180
Making me come
to a place like this...

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.520
What about your memory search?

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.600
Hey, I want to see a dolphin.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:33.020
Make one come out
by the time I count to three...

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.520
You don't care anymore?

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:36.320
I don't want to think about it.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.980
You're just giving up?

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:40.150
Well, what else can I do?

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:42.280
If I think about it, my head hurts,

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:45.030
and even if something hits me,
it vanishes just like that!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.450
Leave me alone!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.620
I've had enough...

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:55.460
All I wanted was to remember...

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:04.970
What's this?

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:06.470
Come on.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:09.310
What the...? Hey!

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:19.480
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:24.990
All right, the time you've
all been waiting for is here!

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:28.660
I'm your emcee,
Just Me Kumasawa.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:32.080
I'm looking forward to
being your host!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:33.290
What?

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:34.250
Aaaand...

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.000
My assistant for today is...

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.500
Circle-oooh!

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.210
Rise-cheese!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.550
I'm his assistant, Rise Kujikawa!

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:46.510
Aaand!

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:50.020
Senpai! Will this cut it?

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:51.770
You nailed it!

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:54.190
All right, let's get this
show on the road!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:55.900
Drive, talent, bearishness...

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.940
go for the win, full speed ahead!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:01.610
This is your Mayonaka
Ohdan Miracle Quiz!!

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:02.780
What is this?

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:05.410
Hey, don't dwell on the details!

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.620
Hey, normally, anyone would dwell!

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:08.580
All righty.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:12.200
Will the contestant, Yosuke Hanamura,
kindly keep his mouth shut?

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.540
How about telling me why
this contestant or whatever

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:19.380
had to beg his dad to let us
onto the rooftop in the dead of night?

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:22.300
Not only that, but now
even Yu's talking weird.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:24.420
All right, our next contestant is...

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:24.420
Listen to me!

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:26.680
Ms. Chie Satonaka!

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:29.600
Hello.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.810
And our next contestant is...

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.190
Ms. Yukiko Amagi!

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:37.480
It's okay to mash
this button, right?

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.480
Are you like, totally into this?

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:43.690
And last but not least, this
person will serve as our anchor!

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:45.700
The overwhelming
favorite to win it all!

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:49.320
Yes, our Sensei has
come to compete!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:50.830
I'll do my best!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:54.870
Hey, did you just get a more
elaborate intro than anyone else?

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:56.790
Why are we doing a quiz?

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:01.290
Aaand, today's big-name guest, Marie-chan!

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:04.340
Now, then! Let's get started!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:05.970
Question 1!

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:08.090
Question 1

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.090
That's my job!

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.760
The Mayonaka Ohdan Miracle Quiz

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:10.890
What flows through
the center of the city?

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.600
The Samegawa River!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:13.720
Correct!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:14.470
Yes!

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:16.230
You're really into this too...

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.150
Question 2!

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.610
What's pinned up in front of
the Yasogami High faculty room?

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.280
Dreams!

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:26.820
Correct!

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:28.490
Good hustle!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:32.410
I don't get these questions at all...

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.040
Question 3!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.870
What's Souzai Daigaku famous for?

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:39.250
Marie-chan!

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:40.710
Uh... um...

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:43.250
Marie-chan, please
give us your answer!

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:45.630
S-Steak skewers!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.220
Correct!

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:50.620
Next, Question 4!
Let's go!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:57.060
What's the name of the beach you can reach
by a short motorcycle ride from Inaba City?

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.850
Shichiri Beach!

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:03.980
What little-known place is
great for watching fireworks?

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:05.150
Takadai!

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:08.550
What kind of shop is the Tatsumiya,
which Kanji's family runs?

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:09.450
Got it!

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:11.450
A kimono shop!

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:12.700
Got it!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.990
A dyed textile shop!

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:16.410
All right!

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:17.160
Dammit!

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.250
You're in fine form, Sensei!

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:21.670
Okay, let's keep the questions coming!

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:22.250
<i>I see...</i>

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:26.250
<i>So this is what memories are...</i>

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.720
<i>My memories,</i>

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:33.470
<i>that I made with you guys...</i>

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:36.470
<i>So that's it...</i>

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:39.770
<i>This is okay.</i>

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:44.730
<i>What an idiot I was.</i>

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:48.650
<i>This really is amazing.</i>

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:52.660
All right, here's
your last question!

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:57.120
You can't see it, you can't touch it,
and you don't even know where it is!

00:20:53.870 --> 00:21:01.370
Last Question

00:20:57.120 --> 00:21:02.080
But it's totally important, and everyday
you get more and more... what is it?

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:07.710
Marie-chan, your answer, please!

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:19.640
Memories.

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:23.770
That is correct!

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:28.650
All right, the winner of this
close battle is Marie-chan!

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:31.150
Congratulations!

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:41.660
You guys are way too pushy!

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:45.040
Marie, I thought you liked quizzes?

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:48.090
Stupid! I hate them!
Quizzes suck!

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:52.670
Hey, you forgot this.

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:04.810
I won't forget.

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.770
Marie-chan, did you
just say something?

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:09.110
No, I didn't.

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:11.690
No, you definitely said
something, didn't you?

00:22:11.690 --> 00:22:12.780
I did not!

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:14.400
You're beyond indelicate!

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:15.700
Hold up!

00:22:30.300 --> 00:22:31.960
No, I won't forget...

00:24:18.450 --> 00:24:19.950
I thought I'd take in
some morning practice.

00:24:19.950 --> 00:24:21.070
All right! You got it!

00:24:21.070 --> 00:24:23.620
Hey, I'm getting motivated!

00:24:23.620 --> 00:24:26.240
Complete combustion!
One-shot challenge!

00:24:26.830 --> 00:24:29.250
It's kinda like a station,
don't you think?
